  "findings": [
    "Steady-state sampling is ~0.535 s per step at 512x512, about 4x faster than the 2026-10-18 comparison (2.08 s); outputs remain hash-identical. Host copies are not the bottleneck.",
    "Fresh-prompt (encoded) median: 14.1 s balanced versus 5.0 s resident, at 15.3 versus 22.9 GiB peak Metal allocation.",
    "Concurrent denoiser function loading cut the first image from ~23 s to 10-12 s, but 3 of 5 concurrent runs settled into slower steady steps (up to ~1.0 s); all 5 lazy runs stayed at 0.52-0.64 s. The change was reverted."
  ],
